                                        "sense_id": "d91dfdf0-436a-319f-b676-b6ca37866d99",
                                        "entry_id": "2deb9e58-0775-3910-8bd3-932747c26123",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a peaceful manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b053ca3-d517-46b9-9196-eb7dfc4ae78a",
                                                "sense_id": "d91dfdf0-436a-319f-b676-b6ca37866d99",
                                                "text": "She and her husband managed to fix up a false floor in one of their rooms in which they fed the roosters; so whenever a picket came in sight her call would bring the whole family out of the woods and clearing into the refuge, where they remained peacefully amongst corn-cobs till the danger had passed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
